abstract: >-
  A rights-safe, evidence-gated, provenance-aware, and applicability-aware
  mechanistic pharmacogenomic research-software prototype. Public v1.0
  demonstrates the generic architecture with synthetic inputs; external
  scientific data and complete C1-C3B route artifacts are not distributed.
